> On Tue, 11 Jul 2017 at 12:05 Marcos Angelini <angel...@gmail.com> wrote:
> > Dear Yves,
> >
> > This piece of code is very useful! thanks for sharing it.
> >
> > Would it be possible to know how do you estimate the parameters standard errors?
