Having thought about this some more, I've realized where the df are coming from. The model is testing whether the relationship between the predictor variables (x6 to x12)  and the outcomes (x1 to x3) are scaled equally to the relationship between the endogenous latent variable (LV3). Hence df = (3-1) * 7. (My fake data tricked me.)

