Subject: Re: How is R-squared (R2, R^2) calculated in lavaan?
Message-ID: <47LBT3o5cyc.Rxo4JkxXBgAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <47LBT3o5cyc.X1txOGqWBQAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
